ull,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107452","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107452","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107452.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107452.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-17T15:35:25Z"},"body":"- Very slightly helps address #111218 \r\n\r\nOur efficient binary math functions have been living in `typedefs.h`. However, they have slowly reproduced and multiplied, and are now threatening to overwhelm the rest of the `typedefs.h` biome. The latest introduction of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106606 has near doubled their number again.\r\nTo ensure the survival of the rest of the habitat, we must move the functions to their own enclosed living space.\r\n\r\nI've selected the existing `Math` namespace for this purpose, but have chosen to make a separate `math_funcs_binary.h` header, rather than adding to `math_funcs.h`. The reason is that callers will likely have little overlap: Collections and low level code are usually interested in binary math, but not normal math, while math code is usually interested in generalized math, and likely won't be using the binary-based functions.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107452/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":2,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107452/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}